Kozilek, the Great Distortion in colourless, built to Bracket 3 rules. This guide is a starting point generated from the decklist — the sections below group what the deck actually contains by what each card is there to do.

# The commander
Kozilek, the Great Distortion :: When you cast this spell, if you have fewer than seven cards in hand, draw cards equal to the difference.

